ncurrency changes (each scan uses its own temp dir). Protected paths from `merge.protected_paths` are not touched by this plan; shipping the pinned binary does need `Dockerfile` or `deploy/` changes and needs a human.\n\n### Size\nM (about 250 to 300 changed lines including tests and docs). Files: new `internal/redact/gitleaks.go`, `internal/redact/multi.go`, `internal/redact/gitleaks_test.go`, `internal/redact/gitleaks_integration_test.go`; edited `internal/redact/redact_test.go`, `internal/closeout/paths.go`, `internal/closeout/paths_test.go`, `internal/servecmd/reaping.go`, `internal/config/{types,defaults,raw,render}.go` plus config tests, `docs/proposal.md`.\ncosts\nlogs\nplan.md\ntriage-engineer.md\ntriage-lead.md","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01FpcKWB6fcMe5TkX5i7Gcr6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
